{"4565080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nightfall Empress", "steam_appid": 4565080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Rise of the Nightfall Empress</strong></h2>The Kingdom of Dravencourt has rotted from within: a tyrant obsessed with immortality, a twisted religion, and arcane arts corrupted by power. In the Underworld—where the souls of wrongfully slain women are reborn as winged demons known as Nightfall Empress—something stirs.<br>An angel named Serena breaks divine law to offer Isabel, a Nightfall Empresses consumed by resentment, an impossible chance: to become mortal again. To earn it, she must ascend from the abyss, wield her whip, and confront King Ferdinand IX, freeing a realm devoured by both holiness and sin.<br>Her ascent is not only vengeance.<br>It is redemption.<br>It is destiny.<br>It is the struggle to reclaim a life stolen from her.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Modes, One Vision</strong></h2><i>Standard Mode</i> – ideal for playing or streaming freely, with more discreet visuals that preserve the dark fantasy atmosphere.<br><i>Integral Mode</i> – for those who want the complete experience, featuring artistic nudity and bolder imagery, always treated with elegance and in harmony with Dravencourt’s decadent world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565080/extras/17627915b719ff69211bbb631600b00e.poster.avif?t=1778691922\" width=400 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565080/extras/17627915b719ff69211bbb631600b00e.webm?t=1778691922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565080/extras/17627915b719ff69211bbb631600b00e.mp4?t=1778691922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Whip, Magic, and Exploration</strong></h2>Armed with her whip, the Nightfall Empress faces hordes of enemies in fast, dynamic combat, growing stronger through equipable spells, an RPG‑style experience system, and freely assignable stat points to shape your build.<br>Accumulate Awareness to awaken new powers and uncover hidden secrets across 7 explorable stages, each featuring a metroidvania‑style map, collectibles to find, and environmental puzzles to solve.<br>The experience draws inspiration from classics like Castlevania and Demon’s Crest, while evolving the legacy of our Swords &amp; Bones saga.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565080/extras/887230d305c61135f41d9b04f8b630d1.poster.avif?t=1778691922\" width=388 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565080/extras/887230d305c61135f41d9b04f8b630d1.webm?t=1778691922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565080/extras/887230d305c61135f41d9b04f8b630d1.mp4?t=1778691922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A unique dark fantasy action platformer blending metroidvania, RPG, and puzzle elements into an intense, uncompromising experience.<br></li><li>Fluid animations and premium character design by GandalfHardcore.<br></li><li>7 evocative pixel‑art stages, dark, decadent, and crafted by Anokolisa.<br></li><li>An epic, obsessive chiptune soundtrack composed by Marllon Silva and HydroGene.<br></li><li>Two gameplay modes: Standard or Integral, with optional uncensored adult content.<br></li><li>Unlock new abilities and collect Demon Crowns to uncover the world’s hidden secrets.<br></li><li>A secret epilogue, “Decursus Infernalis,” reserved for those who dare to go further.<br></li><li>Deep progression system: level up and freely distribute Isabel’s stat points.<br></li><li>Fast, satisfying combat: dominate foes with the whip and unleash two equipable spells chosen from a set of powerful abilities.<br></li><li>Complete bestiary to explore the dark lore behind every creature.<br></li><li>8 unique, ruthless, memorable bosses ready to test your determination.<br></li><li>Dozens of achievements for those who want to prove they have mastered the darkness.</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Rise of the Nightfall Empress</strong></h2>The Kingdom of Dravencourt has rotted from within: a tyrant obsessed with immortality, a twisted religion, and arcane arts corrupted by power. In the Underworld—where the souls of wrongfully slain women are reborn as winged demons known as Nightfall Empress—something stirs.<br>An angel named Serena breaks divine law to offer Isabel, a Nightfall Empresses consumed by resentment, an impossible chance: to become mortal again. To earn it, she must ascend from the abyss, wield her whip, and confront King Ferdinand IX, freeing a realm devoured by both holiness and sin.<br>Her ascent is not only vengeance.<br>It is redemption.<br>It is destiny.<br>It is the struggle to reclaim a life stolen from her.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Modes, One Vision</strong></h2><i>Standard Mode</i> – ideal for playing or streaming freely, with more discreet visuals that preserve the dark fantasy atmosphere.<br><i>Integral Mode</i> – for those who want the complete experience, featuring artistic nudity and bolder imagery, always treated with elegance and in harmony with Dravencourt’s decadent world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565080/extras/17627915b719ff69211bbb631600b00e.poster.avif?t=1778691922\" width=400 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565080/extras/17627915b719ff69211bbb631600b00e.webm?t=1778691922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565080/extras/17627915b719ff69211bbb631600b00e.mp4?t=1778691922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Whip, Magic, and Exploration</strong></h2>Armed with her whip, the Nightfall Empress faces hordes of enemies in fast, dynamic combat, growing stronger through equipable spells, an RPG‑style experience system, and freely assignable stat points to shape your build.<br>Accumulate Awareness to awaken new powers and uncover hidden secrets across 7 explorable stages, each featuring a metroidvania‑style map, collectibles to find, and environmental puzzles to solve.<br>The experience draws inspiration from classics like Castlevania and Demon’s Crest, while evolving the legacy of our Swords &amp; Bones saga.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565080/extras/887230d305c61135f41d9b04f8b630d1.poster.avif?t=1778691922\" width=388 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565080/extras/887230d305c61135f41d9b04f8b630d1.webm?t=1778691922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565080/extras/887230d305c61135f41d9b04f8b630d1.mp4?t=1778691922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A unique dark fantasy action platformer blending metroidvania, RPG, and puzzle elements into an intense, uncompromising experience.<br></li><li>Fluid animations and premium character design by GandalfHardcore.<br></li><li>7 evocative pixel‑art stages, dark, decadent, and crafted by Anokolisa.<br></li><li>An epic, obsessive chiptune soundtrack composed by Marllon Silva and HydroGene.<br></li><li>Two gameplay modes: Standard or Integral, with optional uncensored adult content.<br></li><li>Unlock new abilities and collect Demon Crowns to uncover the world’s hidden secrets.<br></li><li>A secret epilogue, “Decursus Infernalis,” reserved for those who dare to go further.<br></li><li>Deep progression system: level up and freely distribute Isabel’s stat points.<br></li><li>Fast, satisfying combat: dominate foes with the whip and unleash two equipable spells chosen from a set of powerful abilities.<br></li><li>Complete bestiary to explore the dark lore behind every creature.<br></li><li>8 unique, ruthless, memorable bosses ready to test your determination.<br></li><li>Dozens of achievements for those who want to prove they have mastered the darkness.</li></ul>", "short_description": "A 16‑bit dark fantasy action adventure with metroidvania‑style maps, RPG growth, and hidden secrets. Lead the Nightfall Empress through a mature journey suspended between the sacred and the profane.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Russian, Portuguese - Portugal", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565080/a43fee3a9b8467c4753c2e9094ef65921043d912/header.jpg?t=1778691922", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565080/09288343422c0ccae3611cb1c23ea6e711ee2bbb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778691922", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565080/09288343422c0ccae3611cb1c23ea6e711ee2bbb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778691922", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> XP, Vista, Windows 7, Windows 8.1, Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.6 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong